{"uid":"8eff3f8e9c703d24","name":"[ELITEA-2377] test_automatic_summarization_toggle_enables_disables_own_fields","fullName":"tests.ui.settings.test_context_management_toggle.TestContextManagementToggle#test_automatic_summarization_toggle_enables_disables_own_fields","historyId":"454606f53a0890d6533bdba272fae5a0","time":{"start":1793938111959,"stop":1793938119690,"duration":7731},"description":"Toggling Automatic Summarization OFF disables its own fields; ON re-enables them (ELITEA-2377).\n\n        Distinct observable from ``test_context_management_toggle_enables_disables_fields``\n        (ELITEA-2374): that test drives the *parent* Context Management toggle\n        and observes the Automatic Summarization sub-section mount/unmount as\n        a unit from the OUTSIDE. This test drives the Automatic Summarization\n        toggle itself and observes its own two children (Summarization\n        Instructions, Target Summary Tokens) — a DIFFERENT disable mechanism:\n        a real ``disabled`` prop (``MemorySummarization.jsx``), not a\n        conditional unmount. Fields stay mounted; assert\n        ``to_be_disabled()`` / ``to_be_enabled()``, never ``to_have_count(0)``.\n\n        Context management is always-on (EL-6898), so the former Step 2\n        precondition (turn the parent toggle ON) now asserts the always-on\n        state instead: the section's Preserve Recent Messages input is\n        visible and enabled.\n\n        AFS: test-specs/settings-user-profile/\n        lextend_automatic-summarization-toggle-enables-disables-fields_ELITEA-2377.md\n        ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Toggling Automatic Summarization OFF disables its own fields; ON re-enables them (ELITEA-2377).</p>\n<pre><code>    Distinct observable from ``test_context_management_toggle_enables_disables_fields``\n    (ELITEA-2374): that test drives the *parent* Context Management toggle\n    and observes the Automatic Summarization sub-section mount/unmount as\n    a unit from the OUTSIDE. This test drives the Automatic Summarization\n    toggle itself and observes its own two children (Summarization\n    Instructions, Target Summary Tokens) — a DIFFERENT disable mechanism:\n    a real ``disabled`` prop (``MemorySummarization.jsx``), not a\n    conditional unmount. Fields stay mounted; assert\n    ``to_be_disabled()`` / ``to_be_enabled()``, never ``to_have_count(0)``.\n\n    Context management is always-on (EL-6898), so the former Step 2\n    precondition (turn the parent toggle ON) now asserts the always-on\n    state instead: the section's Preserve Recent Messages input is\n    visible and enabled.\n\n    AFS: test-specs/settings-user-profile/\n    lextend_automatic-summarization-toggle-enables-disables-fields_ELITEA-2377.md\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1793936013172,"stop":1793936013172,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1793936013172,"stop":1793936013172,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1793936013172,"stop":1793936013172,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1793936013172,"stop":1793936013172,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"browser","time":{"start":1793936013172,"stop":17939